    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A companion for everyday life</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f Shower Him with Love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your fish the attention and affection he deserves, but remember: moderation is key! Too much fussing might make him a little cranky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/fe2adc48776b1e7245b944abacf017f9.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/fe2adc48776b1e7245b944abacf017f9.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Create a Thriving Habitat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduce corals and plants into his environment, not just for beauty but to help sustain him naturally. With the right setup, you won't have to constantly worry about feeding him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/ebf8c54a1043de1b132e3d6bf9e568da.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/ebf8c54a1043de1b132e3d6bf9e568da.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Maintain a Clean Home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep his aquarium sparkling by cleaning it regularly or invest in an automatic filter to do the job for you. A clean tank equals a happy fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/466afa74ef8571c2512f4c48912e10e8.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/466afa74ef8571c2512f4c48912e10e8.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Ensure His Safety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be vigilant and take good care of your fish. A safe, healthy environment will keep him thriving for years to come. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/22b195ce1b903566256bb968e4eea80d.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/22b195ce1b903566256bb968e4eea80d.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A companion for everyday life</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc1f Shower Him with Love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your fish the attention and affection he deserves, but remember: moderation is key! Too much fussing might make him a little cranky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/fe2adc48776b1e7245b944abacf017f9.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/fe2adc48776b1e7245b944abacf017f9.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Create a Thriving Habitat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduce corals and plants into his environment, not just for beauty but to help sustain him naturally. With the right setup, you won't have to constantly worry about feeding him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/ebf8c54a1043de1b132e3d6bf9e568da.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/ebf8c54a1043de1b132e3d6bf9e568da.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Maintain a Clean Home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep his aquarium sparkling by cleaning it regularly or invest in an automatic filter to do the job for you. A clean tank equals a happy fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/466afa74ef8571c2512f4c48912e10e8.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/466afa74ef8571c2512f4c48912e10e8.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Ensure His Safety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be vigilant and take good care of your fish. A safe, healthy environment will keep him thriving for years to come. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/22b195ce1b903566256bb968e4eea80d.poster.avif?t=1753742689\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703330/extras/22b195ce1b903566256bb968e4eea80d.webm?t=1753742689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
